{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b88df3ebe3048b0a","name":"Communication Scanner","source":{"id":"source:reference-b88df3ebe3048b0a","title":"Communication Scanner","revision":20849,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:38:40Z","sha256":"7bb7c9b87f3a89167967215507d9fd7f18426ee4a43b8e7a46e2d60f2527d51f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20849","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Communication%20Scanner&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b88df3ebe3048b0a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Communication Scanner is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"},"-sized device used to intercept, analyze, decode, and record ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"},", transceiver, and HoloNet transmissions. Unencrypted broadcasts are automatically picked up. By making a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check, the user can determine the number and types of communication being broadcasted and received within a 50-kilometer radius. A DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check reveals the direction and distance of a broadcast. The Communications Scanner grants a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to decipher encrypted messages that it receives. However, it cannot be used to locate the presence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tightbeam Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tightbeam_Comlinks"}," unless the Communication Scanner is directly in the path of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tightbeam Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tightbeam_Comlink","referenceId":"reference:955c2d21f2824a12"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, the Communication Scanner functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recording Unit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recording_Unit","referenceId":"reference:6d05309737113ae6"}," for the transmissions it intercepts. \n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
